   688	    """One driver entry per selected row: the checkpoint to verify (target + expected
   689	    sha256 + NAS manifest key), the farm link, every artifact path, whether it dumps
   690	    (``no_dump_blocks`` deselects a block's dumps, A3), and the exact evaluator argv."""
