   715	    is not the expected one and a tree digest at the spawn / after the run that is not the
   716	    campaign's; binds the committed artifacts' digests and, for a dump, its evidence (B6); and
   717	    (rB-F2 F2-6) the evaluator's digest of the bytes it deserialized, which must equal the
   718	    expected one, with the length the driver measured (``ckpt_bytes``)."""
   719	    if ckpt_sha256 != entry["sha256"]:
